WEBVTT

00:04.000 --> 00:06.058
Hi, friends. Hani here.

00:06.058 --> 00:11.011
Stand tall beside your desk. Feet together, nice and strong.

00:11.011 --> 00:16.092
Rest one hand on your desk. That hand can help you the whole time.

00:16.092 --> 00:19.050
Today we fly like airplanes.

00:19.050 --> 00:25.096
An airplane balances on one leg, tips forward, and floats the other leg up behind.

00:25.096 --> 00:29.084
Your arms become wings. Your desk is your helper — holding on is real flying.

00:29.084 --> 00:35.000
Shift all your weight onto your left foot. Hand stays on your desk.

00:35.000 --> 00:40.017
Tip forward, slow and easy… and let your right foot float up behind you.

00:40.017 --> 00:44.069
Even a tiny float is flying. Stretch your free arm back, like a wing.

00:44.069 --> 00:49.021
Breathe and fly. Airplanes wobble in the wind — wobbling means you're flying.

00:49.021 --> 00:53.009
Slowly set your foot down. Shake out both legs.

00:53.009 --> 00:57.061
Other side. Weight onto your right foot. Hand on your desk.

00:57.061 --> 01:02.013
Tip forward, slow… left foot floats up behind you.

01:02.013 --> 01:12.047
Free arm stretches back, like a wing. Breathe and fly.

01:12.047 --> 01:16.034
Foot down. Both feet on the floor.

01:16.034 --> 01:21.051
Hands at your heart. One easy breath…

01:21.051 --> 01:26.068
You flew two airplanes. Ready to learn.
